 "limitations": [
  "One scenario is drawn: registration through POST /api/auth/register. The Swing Registration frame replaces AuthenticationController as the entry and calls LibraryFacade.register with the same arguments (see V1).",
  "Failure paths are not drawn as messages: UserManager throws IllegalArgumentException (invalid input, email already associated, identifier already in use) and RuntimeException when UserRegistry.registerUser returns false; RestExceptionHandler maps IllegalArgumentException to HTTP 400 (read, not claimed).",
  "Return messages and UserManager's private validation methods are not drawn (self-calls); findUserByEmail inside UserRegistry is folded into step 5.",
  "Layer groups are shown as boxes; the actor and 7 lifelines make 8 elements, the cap for this level."
 ],
